                <note rend="inline" type="source">612.119/2846: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Consul at Monterey</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bowman</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-05-04T16:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 4, 1920—4
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your May 1, noon.</p>
                <p>Department approves your suggestion to Governor on question of munitions.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Colby</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
